ane fortunately for them the  incredibly deadly Viper swims out to  their boat with an apples suggesting  they could have survived and prevented  the disease and spreading to the  mainland  there's so many references packed into  this final episode in the series as a  whole that I'm working on another video  about the show and how it relates to the  books I'll add a card with the link here  and in the video description as soon as  it's ready the finale also delivers a  few more answers about the fates of  other notable characters in the series  the Quagmire triplets survival is  uncertain in the books but chapter 14 of  the TV show tells us that they survived  fire and eagles to be reunited safely  Fiona's fate in the books was also  unclear but in the show we see that both  she and her brother Fernald made it  through and end up reunited with her  stepfather Captain Widow shion's the  survival of the quagmires and  widdershins might also mean that it's  possible violet could rekindle her  romantic connection with one of the  quagmire brothers at some point and  Klaus might also reconnect with Fiona  who he crushed on after meeting her  olaf's troupe who abandoned him after  the white faced woman refused to throw  Sonny off mount brought also get a  pleasant ending in the TV series as we  see they finally get perform on stage  together at least for one night now that  a series of unfortunate events is over  how do you feel about how it ended and  did the show leave any questions and  answered for you let me know your  thoughts and any theories in the  comments below if you enjoyed this then  every week I have new deep dives into TV  shows and movie so hit the subscribe  button and bail to stay up to date with  all my new videos  next up tapleft for a new and fortunate  events video or tap write for another  video you're sure to like thanks for  watching and see you next time you pick  a movie lovers

